restoreQuote() restored any quote id taken from the request (datatransTrxId / lightbox transactionId)
into the current checkout session; now only the session last_quote_id is restored.
Minicart mixin force-reloaded the cart section on every page view; replaced by a one-time
section_data_clean cookie set after a successful restore.

